# Runtime-generated stickers (do not commit)
#
# These are extension patterns, not `assets/stickers/*`, because the `lbp`
# packager honours glob patterns but not gitignore `!` negation. A wildcard
# therefore also drops `.gitkeep`, the package loses its empty assets/stickers
# directory, and every materialised sticker 404s on a fresh install.
assets/stickers/*.png
assets/stickers/*.jpg
assets/stickers/*.jpeg
assets/stickers/*.gif
assets/stickers/*.webp
assets/stickers/*.bmp
assets/stickers/*.tmp
!assets/stickers/.gitkeep

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
